 `#fetch` tool with all 6 urls. If you run this a few times, I've noticed that the majority of the time the model (Claude 3.7 in my case) did the right thing and called the tool with 6 urls.\n\nWith that said, there does still seem to be a bug here because when it calls the tool with the 6 urls... It says it fetched all 6 pages, but then the request hangs forever and never responds. This seems to be a bug in how we handle multiple urls.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2821407372/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2860877593","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7959#issuecomment-2860877593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7959","id":2860877593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6qhYcZ","user":{"login":"TylerLeonhardt","id":2644648,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NDQ2NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2644648?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt","html_url":"https://github.com/TylerLeonhardt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TylerLeonhardt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user